hadiths[249]{hadithnumber,text}:
"751","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abdur Rahman bin Ruzain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rabadzah se guzre; hum se kaha gaya: ""Yahan Salamah bin al-Akwa hain."" Hum unke paas aaye aur unhein salam kiya; unhon ne apne donon hath nikale, phir kaha: ""Main ne in donon se Nabi Allah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki baiat ki."" Phir unhon ne apni badi hatheli nikali goya oont ki hatheli ho, phir hum uski taraf uthe aur use bosa diya."
"752","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Mijlaz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya bahar nikle aur Abdullah bin Amir aur Abdullah bin Zubair baithe the, Ibn Amir khade hue, Ibn Zubair baithe rahe aur woh donon mein sab se wazan-daar the. Muawiya ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jise khush kare ke Allah ke bande uske liye khade hon, use chahiye ke aag mein apna ghar bana le."
"753","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Allah ne Aadam (alaihis salam) ko [apni soorat par] paida kiya, aur unka qad saath haath tha, phir farmaya: Jao, un par salam karo farishton ke giroh jo baithe hain phir suno woh tumhein kya tehiyyat dete hain be-shak woh tumhari tehiyyat aur tumhari aulaad ki tehiyyat hai, Unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum, Unhon ne kaha: Alaikas salam wa rahmatullah, Phir unhon ne izafa kiya: wa rahmatullah, Phir jo jannat mein dakhil hoga uski soorat par, phir khalq mein kami hoti rahi yahan tak ke ab."
"754","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Bara se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Salam phailao salamti paoge."
"755","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum jannat mein dakhil nahin hoge yahan tak ke iman lao; iman nahin laoge yahan tak ke ek doosre se muhabbat karo. Kya main tumhein us par rahnumayi na karun jis se tum ek doosre se muhabbat karo?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kyun nahin, Ya Rasoolullah."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne darmiyan salam phailao."
"756","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Rahman ki ibadat karo, khana khilao, salam phailao, jannaton mein dakhil hoge."
"757","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Bushair bin Yasar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Koi shakhs na tha jo Ibn Umar se salam mein pehal karta ya jaldi karta."
"758","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Sawar paidal ko salam kare, paidal baithe ko, aur do paidal, un mein jo salam mein pehal kare woh afzal hai."
"759","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Agharr jo Muzainah mein se ek mard tha, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath uski sohbat thi uske Bani Amr bin Auf mein se ek shakhs par khajoor ke chand wasq the, woh uske paas baar baar gaya, Unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya; Aap ne mere sath Abu Bakr Siddiq ko bheja, Unhon ne kaha: Hum jin se mile unhon ne hamein salam kiya, phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: ""Kya tum nahin dekhte log tumhein salam mein pehal karte hain, phir unke liye ajr hoga? Unhein salam mein pehal karo tumhare liye ajr hoga."" Ibn Umar yeh apne bare mein bayan karte hain."
"760","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Ayyub se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi musalman mard ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh apne bhai se teen se zyada hijr kare, phir donon milein, toh yeh munh phere aur woh munh phere; aur un donon mein se bahtar woh hai jo salam mein pehal kare."
"761","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par guzra jab Aap majlis mein the aur bola: ""Assalamu alaikum."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Das nekiyan."" Phir doosra shakhs guzra, phir bola: ""Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Bees nekiyan."" Phir doosra shakhs guzra, phir bola: ""Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tees nekiyan."" Majlis mein se ek shakhs khada hua, aur salam nahin kiya! Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tumhara sathi kitna jald bhool gaya! Jab tum mein se koi majlis mein aaye toh use salam karna chahiye; agar use baithna ho toh baithe, aur jab khada ho [doosri riwayat mein: phir baithe phir use khada hona ho majlis ke muntashir hone se pehle] toh use salam karna chahiye; pehli aakhri se zyada haqdar nahin."
"762","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Bakr ke peeche sawar tha, woh qaum par guzre aur kehte: ""Assalamu alaikum,"" woh kehte: ""Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah,"" aur woh kehte: ""Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullah,"" woh kehte: ""Assalamu alaikum wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh,"" phir Abu Bakr ne kaha: Logon ne aaj hamein zyada izafe se fazeelat payi."
"763","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Yahudiyon ne tum se kisi cheez par hasad nahin kiya jaise unhon ne tum se salam aur aameen par hasad kiya."
"764","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak salam Allah Taala ke naamon mein se naam hai, Allah ne use zameen mein rakha, phir apne darmiyan salam phailao."
"765","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Masud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz parhte the, phir kehne wale ne kaha: Assalamu alallah. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni namaz poori ki Aap ne farmaya: ""Kehne wala kaun hai: Assalamu alallah? Be-shak Allah as-Salam hai, lekin kaho: At-tahiyyatu lillahi wash-shalawatu wath-thayyibat, assalamu alaika ayyuhan Nabiyyu wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh, assalamu alaina wa ala ibadillahish shalihin, ashhadu alla ilaha illallah, wa ashhadu anna Muhammadan abduhu wa Rasuluhu."" Unhon ne kaha: Woh use seekhte the jaise tum mein se ek Quran ki surah seekhta hai."
"766","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Musalman par musalman ka haq chhe hain."" Poocha gaya: Woh kya hain [Ya Rasoolullah]? Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab use milo toh use salam karo, jab woh tumhein bulaye toh use jawab do, jab woh tum se nasihat mange toh use nasihat karo, jab woh chheenke phir Allah ki hamd kare toh use jawab do, jab woh beemar ho uski iyadat karo, jab woh mare uske sath chalo [doosri riwayat mein: uske peeche chalo]."
"767","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdur Rahman bin Shibl se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Sawar ko paidal par salam karna chahiye, paidal ko baithe par, kam ko zyada par, phir jo salam ka jawab de toh woh uske liye hai, aur jo jawab na de toh uske liye kuchh nahin."
"768","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sawar paidal ko salam kare, [doosri riwayat mein: chhota bade ko] paidal baithe ko, kam zyada ko."
"769","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Fadhalah [bin Ubaid] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sawar baithe ko salam kare, [doosri riwayat mein: Sawar paidal ko salam kare; paidal baithe ko; doosri mein: khada], aur kam zyada ko."
"770","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Husain se, Shaabi se: ke woh sawar se mile aur use salam mein pehal ki. Main ne kaha: ""Tum use salam mein pehal karte ho?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Main ne Shuraih ko paidal salam mein pehal karte dekha."
"771","[AI-translation] Asma ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne auraton ki taraf hath se salam ka ishara kiya."
"772","[AI-translation] Ata bin Abi Rabah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Woh hath se salam ko na-pasand karte the,"" ya unhon ne kaha: ""Woh hath se salam ko na-pasand karte the."
"773","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Sabit bin Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main majlis mein aaya jis mein Abdullah bin Umar the, Unhon ne kaha: ""Jab salam karo toh sunao; be-shak woh Allah ki taraf se mubarak tayyib tehiyyat hai."
"774","[AI-translation] Tufail bin Ubayy bin Kaab se riwayat hai ke woh Abdullah bin Umar ke paas jate the, unke sath subah bazaar jate. Unhon ne kaha: Jab hum subah bazaar jate, Abdullah bin Umar raddi bechne wale, dukandar, miskeen, aur kisi par guzarte magar use salam karte. Tufail ne kaha: Ek din main Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya; unhon ne mujhe bazaar apne peeche lagaya. Main ne kaha: ""Tum bazaar mein kya karte ho? Tum tijarat par nahin rukte, saman ke bare mein nahin poochte, bhao nahin karte, bazaar ki majlison mein nahin baithe; hamare sath yahan baitho baat karo."" Abdullah ne mujh se kaha: ""Ae Abu Batn! Aur Tufail bade pait wale the hum subah sirf salam ke liye jate hain [salam karte] hain jise hum milte hain."
"775","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan) Muawiya bin Qurrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se kaha: ""Ae mere bete! Agar tum majlis mein ho jiski khair ki umeed rakho, phir tumhein hajat jald kare, toh kaho: salamun alaikum; be-shak tum unhein us mein jo unhon ne us majlis mein paya shareek karte ho. Aur koi qaum nahin jo majlis mein baithe, phir us se muntashir ho jab Allah ka zikr na kiya, magar goya woh gadhe ki murdar se muntashir hue."
"776","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: ""Jo apne bhai se mile use salam karna chahiye; agar unke darmiyan ped ya deewar haail ho, phir use mile toh use salam karna chahiye."
"777","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai: ""Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba hote [chalte]; ped unke samne aata, phir un mein se ek giroh uske dayein aur ek giroh uske bayein jata, phir jab milte ek doosre ko salam karte."
"778","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Sabit Bunani se riwayat hai: ""Ke Anas jab subah karte apne hath ko khushbudar tel se lagate, apne bhaiyon se musafaha ke liye."
"779","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Kaun sa Islam bahtar hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Khana khilao, aur use salam karo jise tum jaante ho, aur jise nahin jaante."
"780","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sehan aur chadhai mein baithne se mana kiya; musalmanon ne kaha: ""Hum uski taqat nahin rakhte, hum uski taqat nahin rakhte,"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Phir uska haq do."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Uska haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Nazar jhukana, musafir ko rasta dikhana, chheenkne wale ko jawab jab woh Allah ki hamd kare, aur tehiyyat ka jawab."
"781","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Tumhare aur fasiq ke darmiyan koi hurmat nahin."
"782","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qaum par guzre jin mein khalooq khushbu lagaye ek mard tha; Aap ne unhein dekha aur unhein salam kiya, lekin us mard se munh phera, phir us mard ne kaha, mujh se munh phera!? Aap ne farmaya: ""Uski donon aankhon ke darmiyan angara hai."
"783","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas bin Waail Sahmi se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur uske hath mein sone ki anguthi thi, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se munh phera, phir jab us shakhs ne Aapki na-pasandeedgi dekhi woh gaya aur anguthi pheink di, aur lohe ki anguthi li aur use pehna, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh shar hai; yeh dozakhiyon ka zewar hai."" Woh wapas gaya, phir use pheinka, aur chandi ki anguthi pehni, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us se khamosh rahe."
"784","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Abd al-Aziz ne Abu Bakr bin Sulaiman bin Abi Hasmah se poocha: Abu Bakr kyun likhte the: ""Abu Bakr se; Rasoolullah ke khalifa."" Phir Umar uske baad likhte the: ""Umar bin al-Khattab se; Abu Bakr ke khalifa."" Amirul Momineen sab se pehle kis ne likha? Unhon ne jawab diya: Meri dadi ne mujhe bayan kiya; Shifa aur woh pehli Muhajiraat mein se theen; Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) jab bazaar mein dakhil hote unke paas dakhil hote unhon ne kaha: ""Umar bin al-Khattab ne do Iraaqon ke aamil ko likha: Mere paas do mazboot shareef mard bhejo; main un se Iraaq aur uske logon ke bare mein poochunga. Phir do Iraaqon ke malik ne unke paas Labid bin Rabiah aur Adi bin Hatim ko bheja. Donon Madina aaye, apni oontniyan masjid ke sehan mein bithayein, phir masjid mein dakhil hue; unhon ne Amr bin al-Aas ko paya. Donon ne un se kaha: Ae Amr! Hamare liye Amirul Momineen, Umar se ijazat lo. Amr uchhle aur Umar ke paas dakhil hue. Unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaika ya Amirul Momineen! Umar ne kaha: Tumhein is naam mein kya soojha ae Ibn al-Aas tum jo tum ne kaha us se nikloge: Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Labid bin Rabiah aur Adi bin Hatim aaye, phir unhon ne mujh se kaha: hamare liye Amirul Momineen se ijazat lo, phir main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam tum donon ne uska naam durust paya, aur be-shak woh: Ameer hai, aur hum: Momineen hain. Khat usi din se chala."
"785","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muawiya Hajj ko aaya apna pehla Hajj jab woh khalifa tha phir Usman bin Hunaif Ansari unke paas dakhil hue, phir kaha: Assalamu alaika ayyuhal Ameer wa rahmatullah, phir Ahl-e-Shaam ne use munkar samjha, aur kaha: Yeh munafiq kaun hai jo Amirul Momineen ki tehiyyat mein kami karta hai? Usman apne ghutne par baitha, phir kaha: Ae Amirul Momineen! Be-shak inhon ne mujh par ek muamle ka inkar kiya jo tum un se zyada jaante ho, phir Allah ki qasam main ne use Abu Bakr, Umar, aur Usman ko tehiyyat di phir un mein se kisi ne use munkar nahin samjha. Phir Muawiya ne Ahl-e-Shaam mein se jis ne baat ki use kaha: ""Apni jagah par tehro; be-shak woh tha baaz jo woh kehta hai, lekin Ahl-e-Shaam mein yeh fitne hue, unhon ne kaha: hamare paas hamare khalifa ki tehiyyat mein kami na karo; be-shak main tumhein samajhta hun ae Ahl-e-Madina tum sadqe ke aamil se kehte ho: Ayyuhal Ameer."
"786","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Hajjaj ke paas dakhil hua, main ne use salam nahin kiya."
"787","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Tamim bin Hudhlam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe pehla yaad hai jis ne Kufa mein imarat se salam kiya, Mughirah bin Shubah Rahba ke darwaze se nikle, phir Kindah mein se ek shakhs achanak aaya unhon ne dawa kiya ke woh: Abu Qurrah Kindi hai phir unhon ne use salam kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaika ayyuhal Ameer wa rahmatullah, Assalamu alaikum. Unhon ne use na-pasand kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Assalamu alaikum ayyuhal Ameer wa rahmatullah, Assalamu alaikum, kya main un mein se nahin hun, ya nahin? Simak ne kaha: ""Phir uske baad uska iqrar kiya."
"788","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Miqdad bin al-Aswad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ko aate, phir aisa salam karte jo soye ko nahin jagata, aur jaage ko sunata."
"789","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Fatima chalti hui aayin goya unka chalna Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke chalne jaisa tha; Aap ne farmaya: ""Marhaban meri beti."" Phir Aap ne unhein apne dayein, ya apne bayein bithaya."
"790","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ammar ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi Aap ne unki aawaz pehchani phir farmaya: ""Marhaban Tayyib Mutayyab."
"791","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas ped ke saye mein Makkah aur Madina ke darmiyan baithe the achanak sakht dehati aaya aur bola: Assalamu alaikum. Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Wa alaikum [assalam]."
"792","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Jamrah se riwayat hai: ""Main ne Ibn Abbas ko suna jab unhein salam kiya jata, kehte: Wa alaika, wa rahmatullah."
"793","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Qailah ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: ""Assalamu alaikum ya Rasoolullah!"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Wa alaikas salam, wa rahmatullah."
"794","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Dharr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jab Aap apni namaz se farigh hue, phir main pehla tha jis ne Aapko Islam ki tehiyyat di, phir Aap ne farmaya: ""Wa alaika, wa rahmatullah; tum kahan se ho?"" Main ne kaha: Ghifar se."
"795","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Muawiya bin Qurrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujh se kaha: ""Ae mere bete! Jab tumhare paas se shakhs guzre, phir kahe: Assalamu alaikum, toh na kaho: Wa alaika. Goya tum use akele makhsoos karte ho; be-shak woh akela nahin hai, lekin kaho: Assalamu alaikum."
"796","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Abdullah bin as-Samit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Dharr se kaha: ""Main Abdur Rahman bin Umm al-Hakam ke paas se guzra, phir salam kiya, phir us ne mujhe kuchh jawab nahin diya?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae mere bhatije! Tum par uska kya hai? Tumhein us se bahtar ne jawab diya; uske dayein farishta hai."
"797","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak salam Allah ke naamon mein se naam hai, Allah ne use zameen mein rakha, phir use apne darmiyan phailao, be-shak jab shakhs qaum ko salam kare phir woh use jawab dein un par fazeelat darja tha, kyunke us ne unhein salam yaad dilaya, aur agar woh use jawab na dein use us se bahtar aur tayyib ne jawab diya."
"798","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Salam kehna nafl hai, aur jawab dena farz hai."
"799","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Logon mein sab se bakheel woh hai jo salam mein bukhl kare, aur be-shak logon mein sab se aajiz woh hai jo dua mein aajiz ho."
"800","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke woh bachchon par guzre, phir unhein salam kiya, aur kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unke sath aisa karte the."
"801","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Anbasah [yani Ibn Ammar] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Ibn Umar ko kitab mein bachchon ko salam karte dekha."
"802","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Umm Hani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gayi jab Aap ghusl kar rahe the; main ne [Aapko] salam kiya, Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh kaun hain?"" Main ne kaha: Umm Hani. Aap ne farmaya: ""Marhaban [Umm Hani ke sath]."
"803","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Auratein mardon ko salam karti theen."
"804","[AI-translation] (Sahih hath ke zikr ke baghair) Asma se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein guzre; auraton ka giroh baitha tha; Aap ne unhein apne hath se salam ka ishara kiya, phir farmaya: ""Nemat dene walon ke kufr se bacho, nemat dene walon ke kufr se bacho."" Un mein se ek ne kaha: Hum Allah ki panah mangte hain ae Nabiullah Allah ki nematon ke kufr se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Balke tum mein se ek lambi bewa rehti hai, phir gusse se ghadabnak hoti hai, phir kehti hai: Allah ki qasam main ne us se ek ghadi khair kabhi nahin dekhi, phir woh Allah ki nematon ka kufr hai, aur woh [nemat] dene walon ke [nematon ka] kufr hai."
"805","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Tariq se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum Abdullah ke paas baithe the; unka muazzin aaya [aur kaha]: ""Namaz khadi hui."" Woh khade hue, hum unke sath khade hue; hum masjid mein dakhil hue aur logon ko masjid ke aage ruku mein dekha; unhon ne takbeer kahi aur ruku kiya; hum chale aur unhon ne jo kiya waisa kiya. Ek shakhs tez guzra aur bola: ""Alaikumus salam ya Aba Abdur Rahman!"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Allah ne sach kaha, Uske Rasool ne pahunchaya."" Jab hum ne namaz parhi, woh wapas hue, apne ghar walon ke paas dakhil hue; hum apni jagah baithe unke nikalne ka intezar karte hue. Hum mein se baaz ne baaz se kaha: ""Tum mein se kaun un se poochhega?"" Tariq ne kaha: ""Main poochhunga,"" phir unhon ne un se poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: ""Qiyamat ke samne: khaas ka salam, tijarat ka phailna yahan tak ke aurat tijarat par apne shohar ki madad kare, rishton ka katna, qalam ka phailna, jhooti gawahi ka zahir hona, aur sachchi gawahi ka chhupana."
"806","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai: ""Ke woh Madina mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aamad par das saal ke the; meri maayein mujhe Aapki khidmat par lagatin, main ne Aapki das saal khidmat ki; Aap wafat pa gaye jab main bees saal ka tha. Main hijab ke muamle mein sab logon se zyada janne wala tha: pehle nazil hua jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zainab bint Jahsh se ghar basaya; subah woh dulhan theen; Aap ne qaum ki dawat ki, unhon ne khane mein se paya; phir nikle; giroh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas reh gaya aur der tak thehra; Aap khade hue aur bahar nikle; main nikla taake woh niklein; Aap chale, main Aapke sath chala yahan tak ke Ayesha ke hujre ki dehleez par aaye, phir samjha ke woh nikle Aap wapas hue main [Aapke sath] wapas hua yahan tak ke Zainab ke paas dakhil hue; toh woh baithe the, Aap wapas hue main wapas hua yahan tak ke Ayesha ke hujre ki dehleez par pahunche. Aur samjha ke woh nikle, Aap wapas hue main Aapke sath wapas hua; toh woh nikal chuke the; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere aur Aapke darmiyan parda dala; hijab nazil hua."
"807","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Saalabah bin Abi Malik Qurazi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Woh Abdullah bin Suwaid Bani Harisah bin al-Haris ke bhai ke paas sawari par gaye teen auraton ke bare mein poochne; woh un par amal karte the. Unhon ne poocha: ""Kya chahte ho?"" Main ne kaha: ""Main un par amal karna chahta hun,"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Jab main dopahar mein apne kapde rakhun, mere ghar walon mein se koi baligh mujh par dakhil nahin hota magar meri ijazat se, siwa iske ke main use bulaun phir woh uska izn hai. Aur na jab fajr tulu ho aur log harkat karein, yahan tak ke namaz parhi jaye, aur na jab main Isha parhun aur apne kapde rakhun yahan tak ke soun."
"808","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath hais [khajoor charbi samet] kha rahi thi, phir Umar guzre, Aap ne unhein bulaya phir unhon ne khaya; unka hath meri ungli se laga, Unhon ne kaha: Hass! Agar tumhare bare mein itaat ki jati, toh tumhein aankh na dekhti, phir hijab nazil hua."
"809","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Umm Subayyah bint Qais se aur woh: Khaulah, Kharijah bin al-Haris ki dadi hain unhon ne kaha: ""Mera hath aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka hath ek bartan mein badalte the."
"810","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab ghair-aabad ghar mein dakhil ho, toh use kehna chahiye: Assalamu alaina, wa ala ibadillahish shalihin."
"811","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: {Tum apne gharon ke siwa gharon mein dakhil na ho yahan tak ke ijazat lo aur unke ghar walon par salam karo} [Noor: 27]; us mein se istisna kiya, phir farmaya: {Tum par gunah nahin ke tum ghair-aabad gharon mein dakhil ho jin mein tumhare liye saman hai ...} Uske qoul tak: {tum chhupate ho} [Noor: 29]."
"812","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai: ""Ke jab unki baaz aulaad baligh hoti, woh use alag karte; woh us par dakhil na hote magar ijazat se."
"813","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Alqamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Abdullah ke paas aaya, Unhon ne kaha: Kya main apni walida se ijazat lun? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Tum unhein unki har haal mein dekhna nahin chahoge."
"814","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Muslim bin Nudhair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Huzaifah se poocha, Unhon ne kaha: Kya main apni walida se ijazat lun? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Agar tum un se ijazat na lo, tum woh dekhoge jo tum na-pasand karte ho"" [doosri riwayat mein: jo tumhein bura lage]."
"815","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas se poocha: ""Kya main apni behan se ijazat lun?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Main ne dohraya: ""Do behnein meri parwarish mein hain, main unhein uthata hun, aur un par kharch karta hun, kya main un donon se ijazat lun?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan; kya tum unhein nanga dekhna chahoge?!"" Phir unhon ne parha: {Ae iman walon, tum se tumhare dayein hath malik ijazat lein ...} se: {tumhare liye teen auratein} [Noor: 58] Unhon ne kaha: ""Unhein in teen auraton mein ijazat ka hukm nahin diya gaya."" Unhon ne kaha: {Aur jab tum mein se bachche baligh hon} [Noor: 59], Ibn Abbas ne kaha: ""Izn wajib hai, [sab logon par]."
"816","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ubaid bin Umair se riwayat hai ke Abu Musa Ashari ne Umar bin al-Khattab se ijazat mangi, unhein ijazat nahin di gayi goya woh mashghool the Abu Musa wapas hue. Umar farigh hue, Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya main ne Abdullah bin Qais ki aawaz nahin suni? Use ijazat do."" Kaha gaya: ""Woh wapas gaya,"" Unhon ne use bulaya, Unhon ne kaha: Hamein aisa hukm diya jata tha. Unhon ne kaha: Mere paas us par gawah lao. Woh Ansar ki majlis ki taraf gaye aur un se poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Tumhare liye is par hamare sab se chhote ke siwa koi gawahi nahin dega: Abu Saeed Khudri."" Woh Abu Saeed ko le gaye. Umar ne kaha: ""Mujh se [yeh] Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke muamle mein se chhupa raha? Mujhe bazaron mein len-den ne mashghool kiya."" Yani: tijarat ke liye nikalna."
"817","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Hurairah se uske bare mein jo salam se pehle ijazat mange unhon ne kaha: ""Use ijazat nahin di jayegi yahan tak ke [chaabi laye] salam se shuru kare."
"818","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar koi shakhs tumhare ghar mein jhanke, phir tum use kankari maro aur uski aankh phood do, tum par gunah nahin hoga."
"819","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz parhne khade the; ek shakhs ne Aapke ghar mein jhanka [doosre tareeq mein: surakh se (doosri riwayat mein: us ne apni aankh darwaze ke surakh se lagayi) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hujre mein] Aap ne apne tarqash se teer liya aur uski aankhon ki taraf seedha kiya [taake uski aankh phood dein] [shakhs ne apna sir nikala] [doosri riwayat mein: dehati peeche hata, chala gaya, Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum thehre rehte toh main tumhari aankh phood deta]."
"820","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Sahl bin Saad se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke darwaze ke surakh se jhanka; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lohe ki kanghi thi jis se Aap apna sir khujate the; jab Aap ne use dekha, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar main janta ke tum mera intezar karte ho, toh main us se tumhari aankh mein marta."" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak izn nazar ki wajah se banaya gaya."
"821","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Ubaid bin Umair se, Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar se ijazat mangi teen baar mujhe ijazat nahin di gayi; main chala gaya. Unhon ne mere paas bheja aur kaha: ""Ae Abdullah! Kya tum par mere darwaze par rukna bhaari hua? Jaan lo log aise hi hain un par unke darwaze par rukna bhaari hota hai."" Main ne jawab diya: ""Main ne tum se teen baar ijazat mangi, mujhe ijazat nahin di gayi; main wapas gaya [hamein aisa hukm diya jata tha]."" Unhon ne poocha: Tum ne yeh kis se suna? Main ne jawab diya: ""Main ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se woh suna jo hum ne nahin suna? Agar tum mere paas us par gawah na laye, main tumhein ibrat banaunga!"" Main nikla yahan tak ke Ansar ke giroh ke paas aaya jo masjid mein baithe the; main ne un se poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Kya is mein koi shak karta hai?"" Main ne unhein woh bataya jo Umar ne kaha. Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Tumhare sath hamare sab se chhote ke siwa koi khada nahin hoga."" Abu Saeed Khudri ya Abu Masud mere sath Umar ke paas khade hue aur kaha: Hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Saad bin Ubadah ki taraf nikle; Aap aaye, salam kiya, Aapko ijazat nahin di gayi; phir doosra salam kiya, phir teesra, Aapko ijazat nahin di gayi; Aap ne farmaya: ""Hum ne jo hum par tha poora kiya."" Phir wapas hue. Saad Aap tak pahunche aur kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Qasam us zaat ki jis ne Aapko haq ke sath bheja, main ne ek baar bhi salam nahin kiya magar main sunta tha aur Aapko jawab deta tha; lekin main ne chaha ke tum mujh par aur mere ghar walon par salam kasrat karo."" Abu Musa ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam, main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadees par moatabar tha."" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan, lekin main ne tasdeeq chahi."
"822","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab shakhs ko dawat di jaye, use ijazat di gayi."
"823","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se kisi ko bulaya jaye, phir woh qasid ke sath aaye, toh woh uska izn hai."
"824","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Shakhs ka shakhs ki taraf qasid uska izn hai."
"825","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu al-Alaniya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abu Saeed Khudri ke paas aaya aur salam kiya, mujhe ijazat nahin di gayi; phir salam kiya, mujhe ijazat nahin di gayi; phir teesra salam kiya aur apni aawaz buland ki, aur kaha: Assalamu alaikum ya ahlad dar! Mujhe ijazat nahin di gayi, phir main kinare hata aur baitha, phir mere paas khadim bahar aaya, Unhon ne kaha: Dakhil ho, main dakhil hua; Abu Saeed ne mujh se kaha: ""Jaan lo agar tum zyada karte toh tumhein ijazat nahin di jati."" Main ne un se bartano ke bare mein poocha? Main ne un se kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin poocha, magar unhon ne kaha: ""Haram,"" yahan tak ke main ne thali ke bare mein poocha? Unhon ne kaha: ""Haram."" Muhammad ne kaha: ""Uske sir par dhakna banaya jata hai, phir bandha jata hai."
"826","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abdullah bin Busr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi se: [ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)] ""[aadat thi] jab darwaze par aate ijazat chahte hue uske samne na hote; dayein aur bayein se aate; agar unhein ijazat di jati warna wapas hote."
"827","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Muawiya bin Hudaij se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur ijazat mangi; unhon ne mujh se kaha: ""Apni jagah yahan tak ke woh tumhare paas niklein."" Main unke darwaze ke qareeb baitha. Unhon ne kaha: Woh mere paas nikle aur pani manga phir wuzu kiya, phir apne donon mozon par masah kiya. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Amirul Momineen! Kya yeh peshab se hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Peshab se, ya uske siwa se."
"828","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai: ""Be-shak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke darwaze nakhunon se khatkhataye jate the."
"829","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Kaldah bin Hanbal se riwayat hai ke Safwan bin Umayyah ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Fath [Makkah] mein doodh, bakri ke bachche, aur sabziyon samet bheja Abu Aasim ne kaha: yani saag Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) waadi ke oopar the; main Islam nahin laya tha aur ijazat nahin mangi thi. Aap ne farmaya: ""Wapas jao aur kaho: Assalamu alaikum. Kya main dakhil hun?"" Woh Safwan ke Islam lane ke baad tha."
"830","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Bani Amir mein se ek shakhs se jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: ""Kya main dakhil hun?"" Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne baandi se kaha: ""Bahar niklo aur use kaho: kaho: Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil hun? Be-shak woh ijazat mangna nahin jaanta."" Unhon ne kaha: Main ne use suna is se pehle ke baandi mere paas bahar nikle; main ne kaha: ""Assalamu alaikum, kya main dakhil hun?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Wa alaika, dakhil ho."" Unhon ne kaha: Main dakhil hua aur poocha: ""Tum kis sath aaye?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Main tumhare paas khair ke siwa nahin aaya; main tumhare paas aaya taake tum Allah akele ki ibadat karo uska koi shareek nahin, Laat aur Uzza ki ibadat chhodo, raat aur din mein paanch namazein parho, saal mein mahine bhar roza rakho, is Ghar ka Hajj karo, apne maal-daron ke maal mein se lo phir use apne faqiron ko wapas karo."" Unhon ne kaha: Main ne un se poocha: ""Kya ilm mein se kuchh hai jo tum nahin jaante?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Allah ne khair jani; aur ilm mein se woh hai jo Allah ke siwa koi nahin jaanta: paanch jinhein Allah ke siwa koi nahin jaanta: {Be-shak Allah, Uske paas qiyamat ka ilm hai aur woh baarish nazil karta hai aur woh jaanta hai jo rehamon mein hai aur koi jaan nahin jaanti woh kal kya kamayegi aur koi jaan nahin jaanti woh kis zameen mein maregi}"" [Luqman: 34]."
"831","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi aur kaha: ""Assalamu ala Rasoolillah, assalamu alaikum; kya Umar dakhil ho."
"832","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas apne walid ke qarz mein aaya; main ne darwaza khatkhataya. Aap ne poocha: ""Yeh kaun hai?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Main."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Main, main?!"" goya Aap ne use na-pasand kiya."
"833","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abdur Rahman bin Jadaan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Umar ke sath tha; unhon ne ghar walon se ijazat mangi; kaha gaya: ""Salam ke sath dakhil ho,"" phir unhon ne un par dakhil hone se inkar kiya."
"834","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Muslim bin Nudhair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Huzaifah se ijazat mangi, jhanka, aur kaha: Dakhil hun? Huzaifah ne kaha: ""Tumhari aankh dakhil hui, lekin tumhari peeth dakhil nahin hui."
"835","[AI-translation] (Sahih imamat ke jumle ke baghair) Sauban se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad-karda ghulam se: ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi musalman mard ke liye halal nahin ke woh ghar ke andar dekhe yahan tak ke ijazat le; agar woh kare toh woh dakhil hua. Aur qaum ki imamat na kare phir unke baghair apne nafs se dua mein khaas kare yahan tak ke wapas ho. Aur namaz na parhe jab [hajat] rok raha ho yahan tak ke halka ho."" Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Is bab mein sab se sahih woh hai jo is hadees mein riwayat hua."
"836","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Umamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Teen shakhs, sab Allah par zaamin hain: agar jiye, kifayat kiya gaya; agar mare, jannat mein dakhil hua: jo apne ghar mein salam samet dakhil hua, woh Allah Azza wa Jalla par zaamin hai; jo masjid ki taraf nikla, woh Allah par zaamin hai; jo Allah ke raaste mein nikla, woh Allah par zaamin hai."
"837","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Zubair se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Jabir ko kehte hue suna: ""Jab tum apne ghar walon par dakhil ho, unhein salam karo: Allah ki taraf se mubarak tayyib tehiyyat."" Unhon ne kaha: Main ne use wajib karte hue ke siwa nahin dekha Unka qoul: {Aur jab tumhein tehiyyat di jaye toh us se bahtar ya us jaisa jawab do} [Nisa: 86]."
"838","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jab shakhs apne ghar mein dakhil ho aur Allah Azza wa Jalla ko apne dakhil hone, aur apne khane par yaad kare, shaitan kehta hai: Tumhare liye raat guzarne aur raat ke khane ki jagah nahin. Aur jab dakhil ho, phir apne dakhil hone par Allah ko yaad na kare. Shaitan kehta hai: Tum ne raat guzarne ki jagah pa li, aur agar apne khane par Allah ko yaad na kare. Shaitan kehta hai: Tum ne raat guzarne aur raat ke khane ki jagah pa li."
"839","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Mujahid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar bazaar ke gharon par ijazat nahin mangte the."
"840","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ibn Umar kapda bechne wale ke saye mein ijazat mangte the."
"841","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Usman Nahdi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Musa ne rahib ko likha uske kitab mein use salam karte hue, phir un se kaha gaya: Kya tum use salam karte ho halanke woh kafir hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Us ne mujhe likha aur mujhe salam kiya, phir main ne use jawab diya."
"842","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Basrah Ghifari se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak main kal Yahud ki taraf sawar hounga, toh unhein salam mein pehal na karo; phir jab woh tumhein salam karein. Toh kaho: wa alaikum."
"843","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum Ahl-e-Kitab [doosri riwayat mein: mushrikeen phir] se milo toh unhein salam mein pehal na karo, aur unhein tang raaste ki taraf majboor karo."
"844","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Alqamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] ne hukmaranon [dahhaqeen] ko ishare se salam kiya."
"845","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahudi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par guzra aur bola: As-sam alaikum. Unke sahaba ne salam ka jawab diya! Aap ne farmaya: ""Us ne kaha: As-sam alaikum,"" phir Yahudi pakda gaya aur iqrar kiya, Aap ne farmaya: ""Use woh wapas karo jo us ne kaha."
"846","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Be-shak Yahudi jab tum mein se ek ko salam kare, toh woh sirf kehta hai: As-sam alaika, Toh kaho: wa alaika."
"847","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Salam ka jawab do chahe woh Yahudi, ya Nasrani, ya Majusi ho; woh is liye ke Allah farmata hai: {Aur jab tumhein tehiyyat di jaye toh us se bahtar ya us jaisa jawab do}"" [Nisa: 86]."
"848","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Usamah bin Zaid se riwayat hai: ""Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gadhe par sawar hue us par [zeen] Fadak ki qatifa par thi; Usamah bin Zaid ko apne peeche bithaya; Saad bin Ubadah ki iyadat ko, yahan tak ke majlis par guzre jis mein Abdullah bin Ubayy bin Salul tha aur woh Abdullah ke Islam lane se pehle tha phir majlis mein musalmanon, mushrikeen aur but-paraston ki milawat thi, phir unhein salam kiya."
"849","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat hai ke Abu Sufyan bin Harb ne unhein khabar di: Hiraql Room ke badshah ne unhein bheja, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki kitab mangi jo [bheji gayi thi] Dihyah Kalbi ke sath azeem [Busra] ki taraf, phir use Hiraql ko diya phir us ne use parha, phir us mein tha: ""Bismillahirrahmanirrahim, Muhammad Abdullah aur Uske Rasool se Hiraql azeem Room ki taraf, salam us par jo hidayat ki pairwi kare, amma baadu; be-shak main tumhein Islam ki dawat se bulata hun: Islam lao salamat rahoge; Allah tumhein tumhara ajr dohra dega; phir tum phire toh tum par Arisiyeen ka gunah hai aur {Ae Ahl-e-Kitab aao ek kalime ki taraf jo hamare aur tumhare darmiyan barabar hai ...} Uske qoul tak: {gawahi do ke hum musalman hain}"" [Aal Imran: 64]."
"850","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yahudiyon ke giroh ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko salam kiya: ""As-sam alaikum."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Wa alaikum."" Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) ne kaha aur ghadabnak huin: ""Kya tum ne nahin suna unhon ne kya kaha?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Haan, main ne suna aur unhein wapas kiya; mere haq mein unke bare mein qabool kiya gaya, unke haq mein mere bare mein qabool nahin kiya gaya."
"851","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Uqbah bin Amir Juhani se riwayat hai ke woh musalman shakl wale shakhs par guzre; unhon ne salam kiya; us ne jawab diya: ""Wa alaika wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh."" Khadim ne un se kaha: ""Woh Nasrani hai!"" Uqbah khade hue aur uske peeche chale yahan tak ke use pa liya. Unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak Allah ki rehmat aur barkatein momineen par hain, lekin Allah tumhari umr daraaz kare, aur tumhara maal, aur aulaad zyada kare."
"852","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Agar mujh se Firaun kahe: Allah tum mein barkat de, main ne kaha: Aur tum mein, aur Firaun mar chuka hai."
"853","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman [yani Ibn Muhammad bin Zaid bin Jadaan] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar Nasrani ke paas se guzre, phir use salam kiya, phir us ne jawab diya, phir use khabar di gayi ke woh Nasrani hai, phir jab jana wapas hue aur kaha: ""Mera salam mujhe wapas karo."
"854","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak main khat ke jawab ko salam ke jawab jaisa haq samajhta hun."
"855","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Ayesha bint Talhah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ayesha se kaha aur main unki parwarish mein thi aur log unke paas har shehar se aate the, phir budhe mujhe apni jagah se aate the, aur jawan mujh se bhai-chara karte the, mujhe hadiya dete, aur mujhe sheharon se likhte, phir main Ayesha se kehti: Ae khala! Yeh falan ka khat aur uska tohfa hai phir Ayesha mujh se kehti: ""Ae meri beti! Use jawab do aur badla do; agar tumhare paas badla na ho, main tumhein dungi."" Unhon ne kaha: Woh mujhe detin."
"856","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Umar ne Abd al-Malik bin Marwan ko baiat karte hue likha; unhon ne unhein likha: ""Bismillahirrahmanirrahim, Abd al-Malik ke liye; Amirul Momineen Abdullah bin Umar se: salam alaika; be-shak main Tum se Allah ki hamd karta hun jiske siwa koi mabood nahin, aur tumhare liye samaa aur itaat ka iqrar karta hun Allah ki sunnat aur Uske Rasool ki sunnat par, jitna ho sake."
"857","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe Ibn Umar ke paas bheja; main ne unhein likhte dekha: ""Bismillahirrahmanirrahim, amma baadu:"
"858","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Hisham bin Urwah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke khatoot mein se khatoot dekhe: jab qissa khatam hota, Aap farmate: ""Amma baadu."
"859","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Sabit ke khandan ke badon se riwayat hai ke Zaid bin Sabit ne yeh khat likha: ""Bismillahirrahmanirrahim, Abdullah Muawiya Amirul Momineen ke liye, Zaid bin Sabit se: salam alaika ae Amirul Momineen wa rahmatullah; main Tum se Allah ki hamd karta hun jiske siwa koi mabood nahin. Amma baadu."
"860","[AI-translation] Abu Masud Jurairi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Hasan se Bismillahirrahmanirrahim ki qiraat ke bare mein poocha? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Woh khatoot ke aaghaaz hain."
"861","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Nafe se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ko Muawiya se hajat thi; woh unhein likhna chahte the. Unhon ne kaha: Us se shuru karo! Woh use dabate rahe yahan tak ke unhon ne likha: ""[Bismillahirrahmanirrahim] Muawiya ki taraf."
"862","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Anas bin Sireen se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ke liye likha; unhon ne kaha: ""Likho [Bismillahirrahmanirrahim], amma baadu: falan ki taraf."" Doosri riwayat mein un se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ek shakhs ne Ibn Umar ke samne [Bismillahirrahmanirrahim] falan ke liye likha; Ibn Umar ne use mana kiya, aur kaha: Kaho: Bismillah, woh uske liye hai."
"863","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Mahmud bin Labid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Khandaq ke din Saad ki kohni zakhmi hui phir bhaari hui, unhein ek aurat ke paas muntaqil kiya gaya, jise Rafidah kaha jata tha, aur woh zakhmiyon ka ilaj karti thi. Phir jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unke paas se guzarte, Aap kehte: ""Tumhari shaam kaisi hai?"" Aur jab subah hoti: ""Tumhari subah kaisi hai?"" phir woh Aapko khabar detin."
"864","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se Aapki us beemari mein nikle jis mein Aap wafat pa gaye; logon ne kaha: ""Ae Aba al-Hasan! Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki subah kaisi hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Subah Allah ki hamd ke sath achhe hue."" Unhon ne kaha: Abbas bin Abd al-Muttalib ne unka hath pakda, phir kaha: Tumhein dekha? Allah ki qasam tum teen ke baad laathi ke ghulam ho, aur Allah ki qasam main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aapki is beemari mein wafat pate dekhta hun; be-shak main Bani Abd al-Muttalib ke chehre maut ke waqt pehchanta hun, phir hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas chalein aur un se poochhein yeh muamla kismein hai? Agar hum mein hai hum use jaan lein, aur agar ghair mein hai hum un se baat karein."" Unhon ne hum se wasiyat ki. Ali ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam, agar hum ne un se manga phir hamein mana kiya gaya, log hamein uske baad kabhi nahin denge, aur Allah ki qasam main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kabhi nahin mangunga."
"865","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad, siwa izafe ke phir sahih-ul-isnad) Abu Zinad se riwayat hai ke unhon ne yeh khat Kharijah bin Zaid aur Zaid ke khandan ke badon se liya: ""Bismillahirrahmanirrahim, Abdullah ke liye; Muawiya Amirul Momineen, Zaid bin Sabit se: salam alaika ae Amirul Momineen wa rahmatullah; be-shak main Tum se Allah ki hamd karta hun jiske siwa koi mabood nahin. Amma baadu: tum mujh se dada aur bhaiyon ki meeras ke bare mein poochte ho..."" phir khat ka zikr kiya. ""Aur hum Allah se hidayat, hifazat, aur hamare sare muamle mein pukhtagi mangte hain; hum Allah se panah mangte hain ke hum gumrah hon, ya jahil hon, ya woh bojh uthein jo hamara ilm nahin, Wassalamu alaika ae Amirul Momineen wa rahmatullahi wa barakatuh wa maghfiratuh [aur Uske achhe salat]."
"866","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan, aur sabit bhi marfooan) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ko suna; ek shakhs ne unhein salam kiya, unhon ne salam ka jawab diya; phir Umar ne us shakhs se poocha: ""Tum kaise ho?"" Us ne kaha: ""Main Tum se Allah ki hamd karta hun,"" Umar ne kaha: ""Yahi hai jo main ne tum se chaha."
"867","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: ""Tumhari subah kaisi hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Khair se; qaum se jo janaze mein hazir na hue, aur beemar ki iyadat na ki."
"868","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Muhajir yani as-Saaigh se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs ke paas baithta tha jo Hadhramaut mein se bada tha; jab un se kaha jata: ""Tumhari subah kaisi hai?"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Hum Allah ke sath shirk nahin karte."
"869","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi mauqoofan, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Huzaifah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Umar bin Sula! Jab tum Qais ko Shaam mein aate dekho toh khabardar khabardar, Allah ki qasam woh Allah ke momin bande ko nahin chhodenge magar use darayenge, ya qatl karenge, aur Allah ki qasam un par zamana aayega woh us se chhoti waadi ka gunah nahin rokenge."
"870","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdur Rahman bin Abi Amrah Ansari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Saeed Khudri ko janaze ki khabar di gayi. Unhon ne kaha: Goya woh peeche rahe yahan tak ke qaum ne jagah li; phir uske sath aaye. Jab qaum ne unhein dekha, woh un se hate; baaz unke liye khade hue taake woh uski jagah baithein. Unhon ne kaha: ""Nahin; main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: Bahtareen majlis kushaada hai."" Phir hate, aur kushaada majlis mein baithe."
"871","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ""Jab tum mein se koi apni majlis se khada ho, phir uski taraf wapas aaye; toh woh uska zyada haqdar hai."
"872","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aaye jab hum bachche the; Aap ne hamein salam kiya, mujhe hajat ke liye bheja, aur raaste mein baith kar mera intezar karte rahe yahan tak ke main Aapke paas wapas aaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main Umm Sulaim par der hui. Unhon ne poocha: ""Tumhein kis ne roka?"" Main ne jawab diya: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hajat ke liye bheja."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Woh kya hai?"" Main ne jawab diya: Main ne kaha: Woh raaz hai. Unhon ne kaha: ""Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke raaz ki hifazat karo."
"873","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi shakhs ko uski majlis se na uthaye, phir us mein baithe, lekin kushaada karo aur wusat karo."
"874","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Jabir bin Samurah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab hum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aate, hum mein se ek jahan pahunchta baith jata."
"875","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abdullah bin Amr se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi shakhs ke liye halal nahin ke woh do ke darmiyan judayi kare, magar un donon ke izn se."
"876","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Shaabi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Abdullah bin Amr ke paas aaya aur unke paas qaum baithi thi uski taraf phandte hue, phir unhon ne use roka, Unhon ne kaha: Shakhs ko chhodo, phir woh aaya yahan tak ke uske paas baitha, phir bola: Mujhe woh batao jo tum ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Musalman woh hai jis se musalman uski zabaan aur hath se mehfooz hon; muhajir woh hai jo woh chhode jis se Allah ne mana kiya."
"877","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: ""Logon mein sab se izzat wala mere paas mera humnasheen hai."
"878","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Kaseer bin Murrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Jumua ke din masjid mein dakhil hua, aur Auf bin Malik Ashjai ko halqe mein baithe paya, apne donon paon apne samne phailaye hue, phir jab unhon ne mujhe dekha apne paon samete, phir mujh se kaha: ""Kya tum jaante ho main ne apne paon kyun phailaye? Taake naik shakhs aaye aur baithe."
"879","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Haris bin Amr Sahmi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jab Aap Mina mein the ya Arafat mein aur logon ne Aap ko gher rakha tha; dehati aate, phir jab Aapka chehra dekhte, kehte: Yeh mubarak chehra hai, main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Mere liye bakhshish mango, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Hamein bakhsh de."" Main ghooma, phir kaha: Mere liye bakhshish mango, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Hamein bakhsh de."" Main ghooma, phir kaha: Mere liye bakhshish mango, Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Hamein bakhsh de."" Woh gaya [thooka, phir] apne hath se [use liya] apne thook ko, aur use apni jooti se ponchha, na-pasand karte hue ke woh apne ird-gird mein se kisi ko lage."
"880","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chadhai mein majlison se mana kiya. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hamare gharon mein baithna hum par mushkil hai?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Agar baithe, toh majlison ka haq do."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Uska haq kya hai, Ya Rasoolullah?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Mangne wale ko rasta dikhana, salam ka jawab, nazrein jhukana, maroof ka hukm, aur munkar se rokna."
"881","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Saeed Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Raaston mein baithne se bacho."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hamari majlison se hamein chhara nahin; hum us mein baat karte hain,"" phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Agar tum inkar karo, toh raaste ka haq do."" Unhon ne poocha: ""Raaste ka haq kya hai, Ya Rasoolullah?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Nazar jhukana, takleef rokna, maroof ka hukm, aur munkar se rokna."
"882","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa Ashari se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madina ke baghon mein se ek bagh ki taraf nikle; apni hajat ke liye, aur main Aapke peeche nikla. Jab bagh mein dakhil hue, main uske darwaze par baitha, aur kaha: Aaj Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka darban hounga, aur Aap ne mujhe hukm nahin diya tha, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gaye aur apni hajat poori ki aur kunwein ke kinare baithe, aur apni donon pindliyan kholin, aur unhein kunwein mein latkayein, phir Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye Aap se dakhil hone ki ijazat mangne, phir main ne kaha: Jaisa ho, yahan tak ke main tumhare liye ijazat lun, phir woh khade hue, aur main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Abu Bakr Aap se dakhil hone ki ijazat mangte hain? Aap ne farmaya: ""Use ijazat do, aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do."" Woh dakhil hue, phir aaye Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke dayein, phir unhon ne apni donon pindliyan kholin aur unhein kunwein mein latkayein, phir Umar aaye phir main ne kaha: Jaisa ho yahan tak ke tumhare liye ijazat lun, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Use ijazat do, aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do,"" phir Umar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bayein aaye phir unhon ne apni donon pindliyan kholin aur unhein kunwein mein latkayein phir kinara bhar gaya, phir majlis mein jagah na thi. Phir Usman aaye, phir main ne kaha: Jaisa ho, yahan tak ke tumhare liye ijazat lun, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Use ijazat do, aur use jannat ki khushkhabri do us balaa samet jo use pahunchegi."" Woh dakhil hue, phir unhein unke sath majlis nahin mili, phir muntaqil hue yahan tak ke samne aaye, kunwein ke kinare par, phir unhon ne apni donon pindliyan kholin, phir unhein kunwein mein latkayein. Main tamanna karne laga ke mera bhai aaye, aur Allah se dua karta hun ke woh use le aaye, phir woh na aaya yahan tak ke woh khade hue. Ibn al-Musayyab ne kaha: Main ne use unki qabron ki taabeer ki; yahan jama huin, aur Usman alag hue."
"883","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) din ke hisse mein nikle, mujh se baat nahin karte aur main Aap se baat nahin karta, yahan tak ke Bani Qainuqa ke bazaar aaye, phir Fatima ke ghar ke sehan mein baithe; Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya Luka wahan hai? Kya Luka wahan hai?"" Us ne use kuchh roka, phir main ne samjha woh use haar pehnati hai ya use ghusl deti hai, phir woh daudta hua aaya yahan tak ke use gale lagaya aur bosa diya, aur kaha: ""Ae Allah use mehbub rakh, aur us se muhabbat karne wale ko mehbub rakh."
"884","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya ke shakhs majlis se uthaye, phir us mein baithe."" Aur Ibn Umar jab unke liye unki majlis se shakhs khada hota, us mein nahin baithe."
"885","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Anas se riwayat hai: ""Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki ek din khidmat ki; jab main ne dekha ke main Aapki khidmat se farigh hua, main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qailula karenge. Main Aapke paas se bahar nikla; toh ladke khel rahe the; main unhein unke khel par dekhne khada hua; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aaye phir un tak pahunche, unhein salam kiya, phir mujhe bulaya, phir mujhe hajat ke liye bheja, phir saaye mein tha yahan tak ke Aapke paas aaya. Aur main apni walida par der hui unhon ne kaha: Tumhein kis ne roka? Main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hajat ke liye bheja, Unhon ne kaha: Woh kya hai? Main ne kaha: Woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka raaz hai, Unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke raaz ki hifazat karo, phir main ne us hajat ke bare mein makhlooq mein se kisi ko khabar nahin di, phir agar main bayan karta tumhein bayan karta."
"886","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi) Saeed bin al-Musayyab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah ko Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sifat bayan karte suna: ""Aap darmiyana qad the jabke qad ki taraf zyada qareeb, sakht safaid, daadhi ke baal kaale, munh khubsurat, aankhon ki palkein ghani, donon kandhon ke darmiyan faasla, peshani kushaada apne qadam se mukammal chalte, us mein godha nahin, mukammal mutawajjuh hote aur mukammal peeth pherte, main ne Aap jaisa pehle na baad dekha."
"887","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo tasveer banaye, use takleef di jayegi ke us mein rooh phoonke aur azab diya jayega, aur woh us mein nahin phoonkega. Aur jo khwab ghadhe use takleef di jayegi ke woh jau ke do dano ko jode aur azab diya jayega, aur woh un donon ko nahin jodega. Aur jo qaum ki baat sune jab woh us se bhagte hon, uske kaanon mein seesa dala jayega."
"888","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abu al-Aliya se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Ibn Abbas ke sath bistar par baitha."" Doosri riwayat mein Abu Jamrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke sath baithta tha, phir woh mujhe apne bistar par bithate, phir mujh se kehte: ""Mere paas thehro yahan tak ke main tumhare liye apne maal mein se hissa banaun."" Phir main unke paas do mahine thehra."
"889","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Khalid bin Dinar Abu Khaldah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik ko suna aur woh Hukm ke sath Basra mein ameer bistar par the kehte hue: Jab garmi hoti Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz thandi karte, aur jab sardi hoti namaz jald parhte."
"890","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas dakhil hua jab Aap patti se bane bistar par the; Aapke sir ke neeche chamde ka takiya tha jis mein resha bhara tha, Aapki khaal aur bistar ke darmiyan kapda na tha, phir Umar dakhil hue aur roye, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: ""Tumhein kya rula raha hai, ae Umar?"" Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam main nahin rota Ya Rasoolullah magar ke main jaanta hun ke tum Allah ke paas Kisra aur Qaisar se zyada izzat wale ho, phir woh duniya mein jo woh karte hain karte hain, aur tum Ya Rasoolullah us maqam mein ho jo main dekhta hun! Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya tum raazi nahin, ae Umar, ke unke liye duniya ho, aur hamare liye aakhirat?"" Main ne kaha: Haan Ya Rasoolullah, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak waisa hi hai."
"891","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Rifaa Adawi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tak pahuncha jab Aap khutba de rahe the; main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Ajnabi shakhs aaya apne deen ke bare mein poochta hai, nahin jaanta uska deen kya hai?"" Aap meri taraf mutawajjuh hue aur apna khutba chhod diya. Aapke paas kursi layi gayi mujhe laga uske paaye lohe ke the Humaid ne kaha: main use kala lakdi samajhta loha samjha Aap us par baithe, phir mujhe sikhane lage jo Allah ne Aapko sikhaya, phir apna khutba poora kiya; uska aakhir."
"892","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Imran bin Muslim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Anas ko bistar par baithe dekha, apna ek paon doosre par rakhe hue."
"893","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Saeed Maqburi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Umar par guzra aur unke sath shakhs baat kar raha tha, phir main un donon ki taraf khada hua, phir unhon ne mere seene par mara, phir kaha: ""Jab tum do ko baat karte pao toh un donon ke sath na khade ho, aur un donon ke sath na baitho, yahan tak ke un donon se ijazat lo."" Main ne kaha: Allah tumhara bhala kare ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Be-shak main ne umeed ki ke tum donon se khair sununga."
"894","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jo qaum ki baat sune jab woh use na-pasand karte hon, uske kaan mein seesa dala jayega; jo khwab ghadhe use takleef di jayegi ke woh jau ka dana jode."
"895","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah [yani Ibn Umar] se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab teen hon, toh do teesre ke baghair sargoshi na karein."
"896","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum teen ho toh do teesre ke baghair sargoshi na karein [yahan tak ke logon mein mil jayein]; be-shak woh use ghumgeen karta hai."
"897","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, us jaisa. Hum ne poocha: ""Phir agar chaar hon?"" Aap ne farmaya: ""Use nuqsan nahin dega, [doosri riwayat mein: phir harj nahin]."
"898","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Qais se unke walid [yani Abu Hazim Bajali] se: ""Ke woh aaye jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the; woh dhoop mein khade hue, phir Aap ne unhein hukm diya, phir woh saaye ki taraf muntaqil hue."
"899","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do libason, aur do khareed se mana kiya: Aap ne mulamasah aur munabazah se mana kiya: khareed mein mulamasah: shakhs uska kapda chhue. Aur munabazah: doosra uski taraf apna kapda pheinke aur woh un donon ki khareed ho baghair dekhe. Aur do libason ishtimal as-samma aur as-samma: ke woh apne kapde ka kinara apne ek kandhe par rakhe, phir uska ek pehlu zahir ho us par kuchh nahin aur doosra libas uska apne kapde mein baith kar ghutne sametna, uski sharmgah par us mein se kuchh nahin."
"900","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Qilabah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Malih ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main tumhare walid, Zaid ke sath Abdullah bin Amr ke paas dakhil hua, phir unhon ne hamein bayan kiya: ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se mere roze ka zikr hua, Aap uske paas dakhil hue, phir Aapke liye chamde ka takiya dala gaya jis mein resha bhara tha, phir Aap zameen par baithe; takiya mere aur Aapke darmiyan hua, phir Aap ne mujh se farmaya: ""Kya tumhein har mahine teen din kafi nahin?"" [Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah!] Aap ne farmaya: ""Paanch."" Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! [Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: ""Saat"" main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: ""Nau,"" main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah!] Aap ne farmaya: ""Gyarah."" Main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: ""Dawood ke roze se oopar koi roza nahin; aadhe zamane, ek din roza aur ek din iftar."
"901","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abdullah bin Busr se riwayat hai: ""Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) unke walid par guzre; unhon ne Aapke liye qatifa dala; Aap us par baithe."
"902","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Qailah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghutne khade bithak [qurfusha] mein baithe dekha; jab main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko baithak mein khushu samet dekha, main khauf se kaanp gayi."
"903","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Hanzhalah bin Hudhaim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aapko chaukdi mare baithe dekha."
"904","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Imran bin Muslim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne Anas bin Malik ko aise baithe dekha chaukdi mare aur apna ek paon doosre par rakhe hue."
"905","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Sulaim bin Jabir Hujaimi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jab Aap burdah mein ghutne samete baithe the; uske kinare Aapke donon qadmon par the. Main ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe wasiyat karo."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum par Allah ka taqwa lazim hai; maroof mein se kuchh haqeer na samjho agarche tum pani mangne wale ke liye apne dol se uske bartan mein dalo, ya apne bhai se khile chehre samet baat karo. Aur tehband latkane se bacho; be-shak woh takabbur mein se hai; Allah use pasand nahin karta. Aur agar koi shakhs tumhein bura kahe jo woh tum mein jaanta hai toh use bura na kaho jo tum us mein jaante ho, use chhodo uska wabaal us par ho, aur uska ajr tumhare liye, aur kisi cheez ko bura na kaho."" Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne uske baad dabba ya insan ko bura nahin kaha."
"906","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hasan ko kabhi nahin dekha magar meri donon aankhein aansuon se bhar gayein; woh is liye ke ek din Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikle aur mujhe masjid mein paya; Aap ne mera hath pakda; main Aapke sath gaya; Aap ne mujh se baat nahin ki yahan tak ke hum Bani Qainuqa ke bazaar aaye; Aap ne us mein tawaf kiya aur dekha; phir wapas hue, main Aapke sath; yahan tak ke hum masjid mein aaye; Aap baithe aur ghutne samete, phir farmaya: ""Luka kahan hai? Mere liye Luka ko bulao."" Hasan daudta hua aaya aur Aapki god mein gira; Aap ne apna hath uski daadhi mein dala; Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna munh khola aur apna munh uske munh mein dala [use bosa diya]; phir farmaya: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main use mehbub rakhta hun; use mehbub rakh aur us se muhabbat karne wale ko mehbub rakh."
"907","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein Zuhr parhayi; jab salam phera, Aap mimbar par khade hue, qiyamat ka zikr kiya, zikr kiya ke us mein badi baatein hain, phir farmaya: ""Jo chahe ke cheez ke bare mein poochhe toh use uske bare mein poochhna chahiye; Allah ki qasam, tum mujh se kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin poochhoge magar main tumhein bataunga, jab tak main apne is maqam mein hun."" Anas ne kaha: Log bahut roye jab unhon ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se woh suna; Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kasrat se kaha: ""Poochho."" Umar apne ghutnon par baithe, aur kaha: Hum Allah se Rabb, Islam se deen, Muhammad se Rasool raazi hue, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khamosh hue jab Umar ne woh kaha, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam aur qasam us zaat ki jiske hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, mujhe jannat aur aag is deewar ke arz mein dikhayi gayi hain aur main namaz parh raha tha main ne aaj jaisa khair aur shar mein nahin dekha."
"908","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Zaid bin Aasim Mazini se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Main ne use dekha yani: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko leta hua, apna ek paon doosre par rakhe hue."
"909","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Takhfah Ghifari se riwayat hai ke woh Ashabus Suffah mein se the; unhon ne kaha: Jab main masjid mein aakhri raat soya hua tha, mere paas aane wala aaya jab main apne pait par soya tha; us ne mujhe apne paon se harkat di aur kaha: ""Utho; yeh aisa letna hai jise Allah na-pasand karta hai."" Main ne apna sir uthaya; toh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere sir par khade the."
"910","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Salim se, unke walid [Abdullah bin Umar] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi apne bayein se na khaye, aur apne bayein se na piye; be-shak shaitan apne bayein se khata hai, aur apne bayein se peeta hai."" Unhon ne kaha: Nafe ne us mein izafa kiya: ""Us se na le, aur us se na de."
"911","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Abu Umamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak shaitan tum mein se ek ke bistar par aata hai jab uske ghar wale use bichhate aur tayyar karte hain; woh us par lakdi, patthar, ya cheez dalta hai; taake woh apne ghar walon par ghadabnak ho. Jab woh woh paye, toh apne ghar walon par ghadabnak na ho."" Unhon ne kaha: ""Kyunki woh shaitan ke amal mein se hai."
"912","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ali se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo ghar ki chhat par baghair rok ke raat guzare, us se zimma baree hua."
"913","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek shakhs se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo kothe par raat guzare phir us se gir kar mar jaye us se zimma baree hua, aur jo samandar mein sawar ho jab mauj-zan ho yani: josh mare phir halak ho us se zimma baree hua."
"914","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Musa Ashari se riwayat hai: ""Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kunwein ke kinare bagh mein the, apne donon paon kunwein mein latkaye hue."
"915","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) subah karte, Aap farmate: ""Ae Allah! Tere sath hum ne subah ki, Tere sath hum ne shaam ki, Tere sath hum jeete hain, Tere sath hum marte hain, Teri taraf uthna hai."" Aur jab shaam karte, Aap farmate: ""Ae Allah! Tere sath hum ne shaam ki, Tere sath hum ne subah ki, Tere sath hum jeete hain, Tere sath hum marte hain, Teri taraf wapas jana hai."
"916","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) in kalimat ko nahin chhodte the jab subah aur shaam karte: ""Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat mangta hun. Ae Allah! Be-shak main Tujh se muafi aur aafiyat mangta hun apne deen, duniya, ghar walon, aur maal mein. Ae Allah! Mere satr dhak, aur mere khauf aman kar. Ae Allah! Meri hifazat kar mere samne se aur mere peeche se, mere dayein aur mere bayein se, aur mere oopar se; main Teri azmat se panah mangta hun ke main apne neeche se halak kiya jaun."
"917","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe kuchh sikhao jo main kahun jab subah aur shaam karun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kaho: Allahumma alimal ghaibi wash shahadah, fatirassamawati wal ardh, Rabba kulli shai-in wa malikah, ashhadu alla ilaha illa Anta, auzu bika min sharri nafsi, wa min sharrish shaitani wa shirkih; use kaho jab subah aur shaam karo, aur jab apna bistar pakdo."
"918","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Rashid Hibrani se riwayat hai: Main Abdullah bin Amr ke paas aaya aur un se kaha: ""Hamein woh bayan karo jo tum ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."" Unhon ne mujhe sahifa diya aur kaha: ""Yeh hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere liye likha."" Main ne us mein dekha phir us mein tha: Be-shak Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe sikhao jo main kahun jab subah aur shaam karun."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Abu Bakr! Kaho: Allahumma fatirassamawati wal ardh, alimal ghaibi wash shahadah, Rabba kulli shai-in wa malikah, auzu bika min sharri nafsi, wa min sharrish shaitani wa shirkih, wa an aqtarifa ala nafsi sooan, au ajurrahu ila muslim [Ae Allah, aasmanon aur zameen ke Paida karne wale, ghaib aur zahir ke Janne wale, har cheez ke Rabb aur malik; main Tujh se apne nafs ke shar, shaitan ke shar aur uske shareek se panah mangta hun; apne nafs par burayi karun, ya use musalman ki taraf kheenchun]."
"919","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Huzaifah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sone ka irada karte, Aap farmate: ""Bismika Allahumma amutu wa ahya [Tere naam se Ae Allah main marta aur jeeta hun]."" Aur jab apne khwab se jagte, Aap farmate: ""Alhamdulillahilladhi ahyana baada ma amatana, wa ilaihin nushur [Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne hamein marne ke baad zinda kiya; Uski taraf uthna hai]."
"920","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne bistar ki taraf jate, Aap farmate: ""Alhamdulillahilladhi ataamana wa saqana wa kafana wa awana; kam mimman la kafiya lahu wa la muwi [Sab tareef Allah ke liye jis ne hamein khilaya aur pilaya, kifayat ki aur panah di; kitne hain jinka koi kifayat karne wala nahin aur na panah dene wala]!"
"921","[AI-translation] (Sahih Abu Zubair ke qoul se, phir woh maqtu mauqoof hai) Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nahin sote the yahan tak ke parhte {Alif lam mim, tanzeel}"" [Sajdah] ""aur {Tabarakalladhi biyadihil mulk}."" Abu Zubair ne kaha: ""Woh donon Quran ki har surah par sattar nekiyon se fazeelat rakhti hain; jo unhein parhe, un se sattar nekiyan likhi jati hain, un se sattar darje buland kiye jate hain, aur un se sattar khatayein mitayi jati hain."
"922","[AI-translation] (Sahih mauqoofan) Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] ne kaha: ""Zikr ke waqt sona shaitan se hai; agar tum chaho, aazmao: jab tum mein se koi apna bistar pakde, aur sone ka irada kare, toh use Allah Azza wa Jalla ko yaad karna chahiye."
"923","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne bistar ki taraf jate, Aap farmate: ""Ae Allah, aasmanon aur zameen ke Rabb, har cheez ke Rabb, dane aur guthli ke Phaadne wale, Taurat, Injeel, aur Quran ke Nazil karne wale! Main Tujh se har shar wale ke shar ki panah mangta hun jiski peshani Tere qabze mein hai. Tu Awwal hai, Tujh se pehle kuchh nahin; Tu Aakhir hai, Tere baad kuchh nahin; Tu Zahir hai, Tujh se oopar kuchh nahin; Tu Batin hai, Tujh se neeche kuchh nahin. Mera qarz ada kar, aur mujhe faqr se ghani kar."
"924","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Bara bin Azib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne bistar ki taraf jate, Aap dayein pehlu par sote, phir farmate: ""Allahumma aslamtu nafsi ilaika, wa wajjahtu biwajhi ilaika, wa fawwadhtu amri ilaika, wa aljaatu zhahri ilaika; raghbatan wa rahbatan ilaika, la manja wa la malja-a minka illa ilaika, amantu bikitabikalladhi anzalta, wa nabiyyikalladhi arsalta [Ae Allah! Main ne apna nafs Tere supurd kiya, apna chehra Teri taraf mutawajjuh kiya, apna muamla Tere supurd kiya, apni peeth Teri taraf lagayi; raghbat aur khauf samet Teri taraf; Tujh se najat aur panah nahin magar Teri taraf; main Teri Kitab par iman laya jo Tu ne nazil ki aur Tere Nabi par jo Tu ne bheja]."" Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo unhein kahe phir us raat ke neeche mar jaye fitrat par mara."
"925","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Bara se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sone ka irada karte, Aap apna hath apne dayein gaal ke neeche rakhte aur kehte: ""Allahumma qini adhabaka, yauma tabasu ibadaka [Ae Allah! Mujhe Tere azab se bacha, jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthayega]."
"926","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Amr se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Do khaslatein jinhein koi musalman shumaar nahin karta magar woh jannat mein dakhil hoga aur woh aasan hain, aur un par amal karne wale kam hain."" Poocha gaya woh kya hain Ya Rasoolullah? Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se ek har namaz ke baad das baar takbeer kahe aur das baar hamd kahe, aur das baar tasbeeh kahe, phir woh zabaan par ek sau pachaas, aur meezan mein ek hazaar paanch sau hain."" Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne hath se unhein ginte dekha. ""Aur jab apne bistar ki taraf jaye use tasbeeh kahe aur hamd kahe aur takbeer kahe, phir woh zabaan par sau, aur meezan mein hazaar hain, phir tum mein se kaun din aur raat mein do hazaar paanch sau buraiyan karta hai?"" Poocha gaya: Ya Rasoolullah! Dono ki hifazat kyun nahin hoti? Aap ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se ek ke paas shaitan uski namaz mein aata hai, phir use falan falan hajat yaad dilata hai, phir woh use yaad nahin karta."
"927","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar ki taraf jaye, toh use apne tehband ke andar ka hissa lena chahiye aur us se apna bistar jhadna chahiye aur Allah ka naam lena chahiye; be-shak woh nahin jaanta uske baad uske bistar par kya peeche raha. Phir jab letne ka irada kare toh use apne dayein pehlu par letna chahiye, aur kehna chahiye: Subhanaka Rabbi, bika [doosri riwayat mein: biasmika] wadhatu janbi wa bika arfauhu; in amsakta nafsi faghfir laha, wa in arsaltaha fahfazha bima tahfazhu bihi ibadakash shalihin [Tu paak hai Ae mere Rabb; Tere sath main ne apna pehlu rakha aur Tere sath use uthata hun; agar Tu meri jaan rok le toh use bakhsh de, aur agar Tu use chhod de toh use us se mehfooz rakh jis se Tu apne saliheen bandon ko mehfooz rakhta hai]."
"928","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Rabiah bin Kaab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke darwaze par raat guzarta aur Aapko wuzu deta. Unhon ne kaha: Main Aapko raat mein der tak kehte sunta: ""Samiallahu liman hamidah."" Main Aapko raat mein der tak kehte sunta: ""Alhamdulillahi Rabbil aalameen."
"929","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Ibn Abbas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo soye jabke uska hath charbi-aloor ho is se pehle ke use dhoye, phir use kuchh lage, toh use sirf apne nafs ko malamat karni chahiye."
"930","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo raat guzare jabke uska hath charbi-aloor ho, phir use kuchh lage, toh use sirf apne nafs ko malamat karni chahiye."
"931","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Darwaze band karo, mashkize bandho, bartan aundhe karo, bartan dhako, chiraagh bujhao; be-shak shaitan band taala nahin kholta, bandhan nahin kholta, dhakna nahin kholta; choohi logon ke ghar mein aag lagati hai."
"932","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Choohi aayi aur batti kheenchne lagi; baandi use daantne gayi. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Use chhodo."" Woh use lekar aayi aur use khumra chaatai par daal diya jis par Aap baithe the; us mein se dirham bhar jal gaya, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum so jao toh apne chiraagh bujha do; be-shak shaitan aise ko aise par dikhata hai phir tumhein jala deta hai."
"933","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne gharon mein aag na chhodo jab tum so jao; [be-shak woh dushman hai]."
"934","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne kaha: ""Be-shak aag dushman hai; us se bacho."" Ibn Umar apne ghar walon ki aagon ke paas jate aur sone se pehle unhein bujhate the."
"935","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Madina mein raat ko ghar apne ghar walon par jal gaya; uski Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di gayi Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak [yeh] aag tumhare liye dushman hai; jab tum so jao toh use apne se bujha do."
"936","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke jab aasman se baarish hoti, woh kehte: ""Ae baandi! Mera zeen nikal, mere kapde nikal,"" aur kehte: {Aur Hum ne aasman se mubarak pani nazil kiya} [Qaf: 9]."
"937","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai: ""Ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghar mein kode latkane ka hukm diya."
"938","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Raat ke sukoon ke baad guftagu se bacho; shakhs nahin jaanta Allah apni makhlooq mein se kya phailata hai. Darwaze band karo, mashkize bandho, bartan aundhe karo, chiraagh bujhao."
"939","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Apne bachchon ko roko yahan tak ke Isha ka andhera ya josh jaye: waqt jab shaitan phailte hain."
"940","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai: ""Ke woh janwaron ke darmiyan ladane ko na-pasand karte the."
"941","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Jabir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Sukoon ke baad nikalna kam karo; be-shak Allah ki makhlooq hai jinhein Woh phailata hai. Jo kutte ke bhonkne, ya gadhe ke reenkne [raat mein se] ko sune, toh use shaitan mardood se Allah ki panah mangni chahiye; be-shak woh dekhte hain jo tum nahin dekhte."" [Aur darwaze band karo, aur un par Allah ka naam lo; be-shak shaitan band darwaza nahin kholta aur us par Allah ka naam liya gaya, aur matke dhako, mashkize bandho, bartan aundhe karo.]"
"942","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se: ke Aap ne farmaya: ""Jab tum raat mein murghon ki aawaz suno, be-shak us ne farishta dekha, phir Allah se uska fazl mango, aur jab tum raat mein gadhon ke reenkne ko suno, be-shak us ne shaitan dekha, phir Allah se shaitan ki panah mango."
"943","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Saayib [yani Ibn Yazid] se, Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Kabhi Quraish ke log Ibn Masud ke darwaze par baithe, phir jab saaya dhalta, woh kehte: Utho, phir jo baqi woh shaitan ke liye hai,"" phir woh kisi par guzarte magar use uthate. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab woh aise the tab kaha gaya: ""Yeh Bani al-Hashas ka aazad-karda sheir kehta hai,"" phir use bulaya aur poocha: Tum ne kaise kaha? Us ne kaha: Sulaima ko chhodo agar ghazi tayyar ho ... Safaid-baal aur Islam mard ke liye rokne wale kafi hain. Us ne kaha: Bas, tum ne sach kaha tum ne sach kaha."
"944","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Doosri riwayat mein Saayib bin Yazid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Umar (raziyallahu anhu) hamare paas dopahar ya uske qareeb guzarte aur kehte: ""Utho aur qailula karo, phir jo baqi woh shaitan ke liye hai."
"945","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Woh subah khate phir qailula karte the."
"946","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Anas se riwayat hai: Madina walon ka koi mashroob na tha jab sharab haram hui unhein khajoor aur busr se zyada mehbub; be-shak main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ko pila raha tha aur woh Abu Talha ke paas the ek shakhs guzra aur bola: ""Be-shak sharab haram ho gayi."" Unhon ne nahin kaha: Kab? Ya yahan tak ke dekhein. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Anas! Use baha do,"" phir unhon ne Umm Sulaim ke paas kaha thanda karo aur ghusl karo, phir Umm Sulaim ne unhein khushbu lagayi, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gaye, phir khabar waisi thi jaise shakhs ne kaha. Anas ne kaha: Unhon ne uske baad use nahin chakha."
"947","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Khawwat bin Jubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Din ke pehle hisse mein sona jahalat hai, darmiyan mein akhlaq [achha], aakhir mein bewaqoofi."
"948","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Maimun bin Mihran se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nafe se poocha: ""Kya Ibn Umar dawat ke liye bulaye jate the?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Unka oont ek baar toot gaya phir hum ne use zibah kiya, phir unhon ne kaha: Mujh par Madina jama karo! Nafe ne kaha: Main ne kaha: ""Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Kis cheez par? Hamare paas roti nahin hai,"" Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Allah, Tere liye hamd, yeh iraq [gosht wali haddi] hai, aur yeh shorba, ya unhon ne kaha: shorba aur tukda, phir jo chahe khaye, aur jo chahe chhode."
"949","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ibrahim (alaihis salam) ne assi saal ke baad khatna karaya; unhon ne Qadum se khatna karaya."" Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Yani jagah."
"950","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Umm Alqamah se riwayat hai: ""Ke Ayesha ke bhai ki betiyan khatna ki gayein; Ayesha se kaha gaya: Kya hum unke liye behlane wali na bulayein? Unhon ne jawab diya: Haan. Unhon ne Adi ke paas bheja; Adi unke paas aaye. Ayesha ghar mein guzrin aur use gaate dekha, apna sir khushi se hilate hue aur woh ghane baalon wala tha unhon ne kaha: Uff, shaitan! Use nikalo, use nikalo."
"951","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan aur maqtooan, aur sahih bhi us se marfooan) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ibrahim (alaihis salam) ne khatna karaya, jab woh ek sau bees saal ke the, phir uske baad assi saal jeeye."" Saeed [bin al-Musayyab] ne kaha: ""Ibrahim pehle hain jinhon ne khatna karaya, pehle jinhon ne mehmaani ki, pehle jinhon ne moonchh kaati, pehle jinhon ne nakhun kaata, pehle jo safaid-baal hue, phir unhon ne kaha: Ae Rabb! Yeh kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Waqar, Unhon ne kaha: Ae Rabb mera waqar zyada kar."
"952","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan wa mursalan) Hasan [yani Basri] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Kya tumhein is par tajjub nahin?"" yani: Malik bin al-Mundhir ""woh [Kaskar] ke budhon ke paas gaya jo Islam laye; unhein janchal phir unke bare mein hukm diya phir woh khatna kiye gaye, aur yeh sardi hai, mujhe pahunchi ke un mein se baaz mare, aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Roomi aur Habshi Islam laye phir unhein kisi cheez ke bare mein nahin janchal gaya."
"953","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan ya maqtooan) Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab shakhs Islam lata, use khatne ka hukm diya jata agarche woh bada ho."
"954","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah bin Abi Talhah ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas uske paida hone ke din le gaya, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) abaa mein apne oont ko khujate hue the, Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhare paas khajoorein hain"" Main ne kaha: Haan. Main ne Aapko khajoorein deen phir unhein chabaya, phir bachche ka munh khola, aur unhein use khilaya, phir bachche ne chabana shuru kiya. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Ansar ki khajoor se muhabbat,"" aur use nam diya: Abdullah."
"955","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad maqtooan) Muawiya bin Qurrah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jab mere Iyas paida hue, main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se giroh ko bulaya aur unhein khilaya, phir unhon ne dua ki, main ne kaha: Be-shak tum ne dua ki phir Allah tumhein us mein jo tum ne dua ki barkat de aur main dua se dua karta hun phir aameen kaho, Unhon ne kaha: Main ne uske liye uske deen aur aql aur is mein bahut dua ki, Unhon ne kaha: Be-shak main us mein us din ki dua pehchanta hun."
"956","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Kaseer bin Ubaid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) jab un mein bacha paida hota yani: unke ghar walon mein na poochhtin: ladka ya ladki, kehtin: Kya woh durust paida hua? Phir jab kaha jata: Haan. Kehtin: Alhamdulillahi Rabbil aalameen."
"957","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Nafe se riwayat hai: ""Ke Ibn Umar apne nakhun har pandrah raat mein kaatte the aur har mahine istidad karte the."
"958","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""al-Maisir: juwa hai."
"959","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se jo qasam khaye aur apni qasam mein kahe: Laat aur Uzza ki qasam, toh use kehna chahiye: La ilaha illallah; jo apne dost se kahe: Aao main tum se shart lagata hun, toh use sadqa karna chahiye."
"960","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ibn Abbas se Allah Azza wa Jalla ke farman ke bare mein: {""Aur logon mein se hain jo ghaflat wali baat khareedte hain""} [Luqman: 6]; unhon ne kaha: ""Gaana aur us jaisa."
"961","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Bara bin Azib se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Salam phailao, salamti paoge; aur takabbur [al-asharah] shar hai."" Abu Muawiya ne kaha: al-Asharah: bekaar kaam hai."
"962","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Abu Musa Ashari se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo nard se khele, us ne Allah aur uske Rasool ki nafarmani ki."
"963","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abdullah bin Masud se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""In donon nishan-zada kaabiyon se bacho jinhein zor se phenka jata hai; be-shak woh maisir mein se hain."
"964","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Buraidah [bin al-Husaib] se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo nardashir se khele, goya us ne apne hathon ko khinzir ke gosht aur khoon mein ranga."
"965","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Nafe se riwayat hai: ""Ke Abdullah bin Umar jab apne ghar walon mein se kisi ko nard khelte pate, use marte, aur use tod dete."
"966","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ayesha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhein pahunchi ke unke ghar mein ghar wale jo us mein rehte the unke paas nard hai; unhon ne unhein bheja: ""Agar tum use nahin nikaloge, main tumhein apne ghar se nikal dungi."" Unhon ne un par use munkar samjha."
"967","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Kulsum bin Jabr se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Zubair ne hamein khutba diya: ""Ae Ahl-e-Makkah! Mujhe Quraish mein se mardon ke bare mein pahunchi jo khel khelte hain jise nardashir kaha jata hai"" aur woh ulta [haath] tha ""Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam: {Be-shak sharab aur juwa}"" [Maidah: 90] ""aur main Allah ki qasam khata hun: mere paas koi shakhs nahin laya jayega jo use khele magar main use uske baal aur khaal mein saza dunga, aur uska maal use dunga jo use mere paas laye."
"968","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Do kaabiyon se juwa khelne wala; khinzir ka gosht khane wale jaisa hai, aur un donon se baghair juwe khelne wala, khinzir ke khoon mein hath dubone wale jaisa hai."
"969","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Momin ek surakh se do baar nahin dasa jata."
"970","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Jo hamein raat mein teer mare, woh hum mein se nahin."" [Sahih al-Adab al-Mufrad: 970] Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Uski sanad mein nazar hai."
"971","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo hum par hathiyar uthaye, woh hum mein se nahin."
"972","[AI-translation] Abu Musa se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo hum par hathiyar uthaye, woh hum mein se nahin."
"973","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu al-Malih se, unki qaum mein se ek shakhs se aur unhein [Nabi se] sohbat thi unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab Allah kisi bande ko kisi zameen mein wafat dene ka irada kare, Uske liye us mein hajat banata hai."
"974","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apne kapde mein naak saaf ki, phir kaha: ""Bakh bakh! Abu Hurairah kathan mein naak saaf karte hain; main ne apne nafs ko Ayesha ke hujre aur mimbar ke darmiyan gira dekha; log kehte hain: majnoon, aur mujh mein bhook ke siwa kuchh nahin."
"975","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Ya Rasoolullah! Hum apne nafs mein kuchh pate hain jo hum baat karna pasand nahin karte, halanke hamare liye woh hai jis par suraj tulu hua."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Kya tum ne woh paya?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Haan."" Aap ne farmaya: ""Woh sareeh iman hai."
"976","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Log hamesha uske bare mein poochhenge jo nahin hua, yahan tak ke kahenge: Yeh Allah har cheez ka khaliq hai, phir Allah ko kis ne paida kiya?!"
"977","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Bad-gumani se bacho; be-shak bad-gumani sab se jhooti baat hai. Aur jasusi na karo, muqabla na karo, peeth na phero, hasad na karo, bughz na rakho, aur ho jao Allah ke bande bhai."
"978","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Anas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni biwiyon mein se ek biwi ke sath the, tab ek shakhs guzra, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use bulaya aur farmaya: ""Ae falan [be-shak] yeh meri zawja falanah hai!"" Us ne kaha: Jis par main gumaan karta tha phir main tum par gumaan nahin karta tha, Aap ne farmaya: ""Be-shak shaitan Ibn Aadam mein khoon ke guzarne jaisa daudta hai."
"979","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Abdullah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Jis se chori hui woh bad-gumani karta rehta hai yahan tak ke woh chor se bada ho jata hai."
"980","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Fitrat paanch hain: khatna, istidad [zer-e-naaf baal mundna], baghal ke baal ukhedna, moonchh kaatna, aur nakhun kaatna."
"981","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad maqtooan) Ibrahim [yani Ibn Yazid Nakhayi] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Hamare sahaba hamein sab khel mein rukhsat dete the, kutton ke siwa."" Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Yani bachchon ke liye."
"982","[AI-translation] (Hasan sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko kabootar ke peeche chalte dekha; Aap ne farmaya: ""Shaitan apne shaitan ke peeche chalta hai."
"983","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad) Zaid bin Sabit se riwayat hai ke Umar bin al-Khattab unke paas ek din ijazat mangne aaye; unhon ne unhein ijazat di jabke unka sir unki baandi ke hath mein tha jo use sanwar rahi thi; unhon ne apna sir khincha. Umar ne kaha: Use sanwarne do. Unhon ne kaha: ""Ae Amirul Momineen! Agar tum mere paas bhejte main tumhare paas aata."" Umar ne kaha: ""Hajat meri hai."
"984","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad maqtooan) Habib bin Abi Sabit se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Woh pasand karte the jab shakhs bayan kare ke woh ek shakhs ki taraf mutawajjuh na ho, lekin unhein aam kare."
"985","[AI-translation] (Hasan-ul-isnad mauqoofan) Ibn Abi al-Hudhail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah [yani Ibn Masud] ne ek shakhs ki iyadat ki; unke sath unke sahaba mein se ek shakhs tha. Jab ghar mein dakhil hue, unka sathi dekhne laga; Abdullah ne un se kaha: ""Allah ki qasam, agar tumhari donon aankhein phoot jayein tumhare liye bahtar tha."
"986","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Nafe se riwayat hai ke Ahl-e-Iraq mein se giroh Ibn Umar ke paas dakhil hue; unhon ne unke khadim par sone ka tauq dekha; baaz ne baaz ko dekha; Unhon ne kaha: ""Tum shar ke liye kitne tez ho?"
"987","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: ""Meri ummat ke badtareen: bahut bolne wale, munh phailane wale, zabaan-daraz; meri ummat ke bahtareen husn-e-akhlaq wale hain."
"988","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ammar bin Yasir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Jo duniya mein do chehron wala ho; uske liye qiyamat ke din aag ki do zabanein hongi."" Ek bada shakhs guzra. Aap ne farmaya: ""Yeh un mein se hai."
"989","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Ayesha se riwayat hai: Ek shakhs ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mangi; Aap ne farmaya: ""Use ijazat do, qabile ka bura bhai."" Jab dakhil hua; Aap ne uske liye kalam narm kiya [doosre tareeq mein: uski taraf khule], main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Tum ne kaha jo tum ne kaha, phir kalam narm kiya? Aap ne farmaya: ""Ae Ayesha! Be-shak logon mein badtareen woh hai jise log chhod dein ya us se bachein uski fahash se bachne ke liye,"" [teesre tareeq mein: ""Be-shak Allah fahhsh mutafahhish ko pasand nahin karta""]."
"990","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Imran bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Haya khair ke siwa nahin lati."" Bushair bin Kaab ne kaha: Hikmat mein likha hai: ""Be-shak haya mein waqar hai, be-shak haya mein sukoon hai."" Imran ne un se kaha: Main tumhein Rasoolullah se bayan karta hun, aur tum mujhe apne sahife se bayan karte ho?!"
"991","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Be-shak haya aur iman jode gaye; jab un mein se ek uthaya jaye doosra uthaya jata hai."
"992","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Bakrah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se [ke] Aap ne farmaya: ""Haya iman mein se hai; iman jannat mein hai, aur fahash jafa mein se hai; jafa aag mein hai."
"993","[AI-translation] (Hasan) Ali se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bade sir wale, badi aankhon wale the, jab chalte jhuk kar chalte; goya chadhai mein chal rahe hon, jab mudte mukammal mudte."
"994","[AI-translation] (Sahih) Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Taakatwar kushti se nahin hai, taakatwar wahi hai jo gusse ke waqt apne nafs par qaboo rakhe."
"995","[AI-translation] (Mauqoof, uske rawi siqah hain, aur sahih bhi marfooan) Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Allah ke paas ajr mein ghusse ke ghoont se bada koi ghoont nahin jo bande ne Allah ke chehre ki talab mein pi liya ho."
"996","[AI-translation] (Sahih lighairihi) Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Sikhao aur aasan karo, sikhao aur aasan karo teen baar aur jab ghadabnak ho toh khamosh raho [do baar]."
"997","[AI-translation] (Hasan lighairihi mauqoofan aur sahih bhi marfooan) Ubaid Kindi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali ko Ibn al-Kawwa se kehte suna: ""Kya tum jaante ho pehle ne kya kaha? Apne mehbub se darmiyani muhabbat karo, ho sakta hai woh ek din tumhara dushman ho, aur apne dushman se darmiyani nafrat karo, ho sakta hai woh ek din tumhara mehbub ho."
"998","[AI-translation] (Sahih-ul-isnad) Aslam se, Umar bin al-Khattab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: ""Tumhari muhabbat zyada na ho, aur tumhari nafrat halak na kare."" Main ne poocha: Woh kaise? Unhon ne jawab diya: ""Jab tum muhabbat karo, tum bachche ki tarah zyada karo; aur jab tum nafrat karo, tum apne sathi ke liye halakat chaho."
"999","[AI-translation] [Allah ki hamd ke sath mukammal hua]."
